================================================================================
呪いの刃  —  2D GOTHIC CURSED-BLADE FIGHTING GAME
================================================================================
Project Summary:
    "呪いの刃" is a production-grade 2D dark-fantasy weapon fighting game built
    from the ground up in Python 3.10+ and Pygame as a single self-contained
    executable file with 100% procedurally generated painterly CG visuals,
    hand-crafted multi-angle keyframe animation plates, and studio-mastered
    44.1 kHz stereo Techno/Breakbeat soundtrack and SFX.

    Playable Character:
        Cecilia Darkmoon — a noble, serene, detached gothic-lolita swordswoman
        with a voluminous high jet-black ponytail, face-framing sidelocks,
        luminous golden-yellow anime eyes, a black-and-scarlet high-collar
        Juliet-sleeve tiered minidress with silver-buckled leather belt,
        thigh-high buckled black leather heeled boots, and a monumental
        demonic rune-etched two-handed cursed greatsword wreathed in crimson
        and magenta spectral flame aura.

    Stage:
        The Drowned Cathedral of Saint Vespera — an eerie cursed swamp beneath
        an apocalyptic volcanic blood-red storm sky and veiled Blood Moon,
        featuring 6 parallax depth layers of ruined Romanesque-Gothic cathedral
        arches, tilted mossy fluted columns, weeping angel and gargoyle stone
        statues, crooked wrought-iron Gothic fences with flickering votive
        candles, gnarled moss-draped swamp trees, lily pads, and interactive
        mirror-reflective swamp water reflecting fighters and slashes live.

    Core Architecture & Craftsmanship:
        - Internal resolution strictly locked to 800x600 with crisp nearest-
          neighbor pixel-preserving scaling to larger viewports.
        - 2x supersampled multi-pass painterly CG rasterizer (masked smooth
          directional gradient shaders, soft airbrush speculars, cool-to-warm
          cel-CG color shifts, ambient occlusion, and variable-weight colored
          anime ink lineart — zero flat Flash rigs).
        - 82 fighting-game states with 740+ individually authored multi-angle
          keyframe plates featuring true 3D torso/head/limb turns, 6-ribbon
          flowing ponytail splines, 9-pleat dynamic 3D skirt silhouettes, and
          true 3D perspective-foreshortened horizontal/diagonal greatsword
          sweeps with multi-layer kinetic motion-smear ribbons.
        - Complete fighting-game combat suite: Samurai Shodown weight, KoF XIII
          combo chains & Shadow Cancel, BlazBlue Cursed Drive & Distortion
          Supers, Soulcalibur Guard Integrity & Sword Clash, Devil May Cry
          Stylish Rank (D -> SSS), Dark Souls Just-Deflect Parry, Adaptive AI,
          Arcade, Versus, Training (live frame-data strip + hitboxes + input
          history), Combo Trials, Survival, Gallery/Codex, Replay, and Jukebox.
        - Glitch-free 44.1 kHz 16-bit stereo studio audio engine streaming 5
          full-length (64-80 bar) progressive high-BPM Techno/Breakbeat tracks
          via native SDL mixer music buffers plus 64 spatialized combat SFX.

    Default Controls (Remappable in Options):
        P1: W/A/S/D or Arrows = Move / Jump / Crouch
            U = Light (A) | I = Medium (B) | O = Heavy (C) | J = Cursed Drive (D)
            K = Throw / Tech | L = Shadow Cancel | H = Eclipse Overdrive
            P = Guard / Deflect Shortcut | ESC = Pause | ENTER = Confirm
        P2: Numpad / IJKL configurable in Options; full USB Gamepad support.
================================================================================
"""

